    ],
    "residual_delay_h": 0,
    "caveat": "Next node for SH-4420 not specified in input; capacity check performed against Rotterdam as a placeholder. Confirm actual routing node before committing crane reallocation."
  },
  {
    "ref": "SH-4417",
    "vessel": "MV-ATLAS",
    "delay_h": 6,
    "options": [
      {"lever": "berth priority", "recovers_h": 6, "cost": "low", "node": "next port (not specified in shipment data)", "note": "Single lever fully covers 6h delay at lowest cost; no need to escalate to crane reallocation or higher-cost levers."}
    ],
    "residual_delay_h": 0,
    "caveat": "Berth priority alone is sufficient and cheapest; crane reallocation not evaluated since not required."
  }
]

Note: full ops-board also included SH-4419 (MV-ORION, At Risk, 2h delay, score 17) which was not in the top 2 and has no recovery plan. Produce the final markdown brief.

